    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d116">

                <pb facs="0364" n="50" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg50"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111N39/17</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ottoman Embassy to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Imperial Ottoman Embassy has the honor to inform the Department of State that
                    the Imperial Ottoman Government has <pb facs="0365" n="51" xml:id="pg51"/>
                    decided to observe strict neutrality in the European conflict now being
                    waged.</p>
                <p>The general mobilization which was ordered at the same time is in the nature of a
                    purely precautionary measure destined to insure the safety of the Ottoman
                    territories.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ottoman Embassy</hi>,<placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>,<date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 8, 1914</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
